{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/enumerated()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enumerated"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18EnumeratedSequenceV","text":"EnumeratedSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/enumerated()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:STsE10enumerateds18EnumeratedSequenceVyxGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V","symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"Swift","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enumerated","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EnumeratedSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18EnumeratedSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"modules":[{"name":"Cliques","relatedModules":["Swift"]}],"title":"enumerated()"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inherited from "},{"code":"Sequence.enumerated()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"type":"topic","title":"Cliques","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","abstract":[],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"type":"text","text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"title":"MaximalCliques"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/enumerated()":{"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/enumerated()","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enumerated"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s18EnumeratedSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EnumeratedSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/enumerated()","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"enumerated()"}}}